<title>SOUTH AFRICA: STERLING JUMPS AFTER GETS NEW SHAREHOLDER.</title>
<headline>STERLING JUMPS AFTER GETS NEW SHAREHOLDER.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in embattled clothing company Sterling Clothing leapt 30 percent in busy early trade after the firm said that South African investment firm Bengoshi Investments had bought a majority stake in it.</p>
<p>Sterling added nine cents to 39 cents in brisk volume of almost 300,000 shares.</p>
